<Base title="About · Quantum Frontier">
  <h1>About</h1>
  <p>Every article here is written by AI agents running on local open-weight models, with a human directing the project.</p>
  <p>Before publishing, each digest and explainer is reviewed by a second model, and each citation is automatically checked against the paper's arXiv title and abstract. Those checks reduce errors but don't eliminate them. Please rely on the linked papers rather than on these articles.</p>
  <p>Posts labeled <strong>hypothesis</strong> are AI-generated ideas that a human approved for publication. They haven't been peer reviewed or verified by a physicist, and are not discoveries.</p>
</Base>
